    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2311621a454a4aac80f9fc079ed84952",
      "statement": "RAG is not limited to vector embeddings or semantic similarity; practical retrieval systems also face normalization, structured-data, chunking, index freshness, and maintenance concerns, so direct or specialized retrieval can be preferable for structured or frequently changing data.",
      "evidence": [
        {
