    },
    {
      "id": "claim_81fe44173d284a4cabf0fa56b6e1dcea",
      "statement": "Memory carries agent state beyond a single model call through short-term working context and externally persisted long-term stores retrieved when relevant; because persistent memory can be poisoned, recalled memory must be treated as an input requiring provenance and policy rather than unquestioned truth.",
