    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ca219020b8c54a54992bce1aa7e8791c",
      "statement": "MCP is a transport and capability boundary rather than a memory or truth layer: an MCP gateway can centralize authentication, permissions, secret injection, anonymization, guardrails, and audit in front of multiple servers.",
